msgid ""
"Reusable platforms that connect products, services, workflows and operations."
msgstr ""
"Plataformas reutilizables que conectan productos, servicios, procesos y "
"operaciones."

msgid "Custom platforms"
msgstr "Plataformas personalizadas"

msgid ""
"Systems designed around specific products, services and business workflows."
msgstr ""
"Sistemas diseñados en torno a productos, servicios y procesos empresariales "
"específicos."

msgid "Built for multiple markets"
msgstr "Preparado para varios mercados"

msgid ""
"Flexible foundations for different languages, locations and commercial "
"models."
msgstr ""
"Bases flexibles para diferentes idiomas, ubicaciones y modelos comerciales."

msgid "Ready to grow"
msgstr "Preparado para evolucionar"

